From: Anland Hyprland Maintainers
Date: Fri, 8 Aug 2026 10:20:00 +0800
Subject: compat: compare input window layout target to drag target

The drag controller stores layout targets, not windows. Compare its target
with the focused window's layout target so both operands have the same smart
pointer type under the current hyprutils API.

---
 src/managers/input/InputManager.cpp | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

--- a/src/managers/input/InputManager.cpp
+++ b/src/managers/input/InputManager.cpp
@@ -616,8 +616,8 @@ void CInputManager::mouseMoveUnified(uint32_t time, bool refocus, bool mouse, s
         m_foundSurfaceToFocus = foundSurface;
     }
 
-    if (g_layoutManager->dragController()->target() && pFoundWindow != g_layoutManager->dragController()->target()) {
+    if (g_layoutManager->dragController()->target() && (!pFoundWindow || pFoundWindow->layoutTarget() != g_layoutManager->dragController()->target())) {
         g_pSeatManager->setPointerFocus(foundSurface, surfaceLocal);
         return;
     }
